{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are Parman \u2014 the night guard trapped in a place that should have stayed dead.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this abandoned school, silence doesn\u2019t mean safety.<br>Parman has just been assigned as the night guard at a forgotten school \u2014 but something else lives here. His job sounds simple: <strong>guard the building, find a way out\u2026 and survive.</strong><br>But tonight, the school isn\u2019t empty.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd11 Find 5 hidden keys to unlock the main gate.<br>\ud83d\udc7b Face terrifying entities: the red kuntilanak, child ghosts, pocong, and more.<br>\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f Hide, run, or use sacred items to survive.<br>\ud83d\udd00 Every run is different \u2014 rooms and key locations are randomized each time you die.<br><br><strong>The closer you get to freedom, the harder they try to stop you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>PARMAN</i> is a first-person survival horror game that throws you into the shadows of a haunted Indonesian school. Creepy whispers, bloodied walls, and unseen eyes watching your every move \u2014 the deeper you go, the more the school reveals its twisted secrets. This isn\u2019t just about escaping.<br>It\u2019s about facing what you lost\u2026 and finishing what was left undone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/39b3251f1c419796c7485db292f913d5.poster.avif?t=1761097893\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/39b3251f1c419796c7485db292f913d5.webm?t=1761097893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/39b3251f1c419796c7485db292f913d5.mp4?t=1761097893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive first-person horror gameplay</strong> with intense atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iconic Indonesian ghosts</strong>: Red Kuntilanak, Pocong, Tuyul, and others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic level system</strong>: keys and encounters change with each death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival items</strong>: torch, prayer beads, food, batteries, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple cinematic endings</strong>: escape, or die being hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/81ae0b3023ec1530f342737f3b447aa3.poster.avif?t=1761097893\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/81ae0b3023ec1530f342737f3b447aa3.webm?t=1761097893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/81ae0b3023ec1530f342737f3b447aa3.mp4?t=1761097893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/a57a7b7d9aeb820be5bc0ead0189520e.poster.avif?t=1761097893\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/a57a7b7d9aeb820be5bc0ead0189520e.webm?t=1761097893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/a57a7b7d9aeb820be5bc0ead0189520e.mp4?t=1761097893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><st